whisper-aloud (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Catalog-driven speech engines (faster-whisper, Parakeet, Nemotron
    streaming) with in-app model download and license consent.
  * Live partial transcripts during recording (PartialTranscript signal).
  * transcribe CLI: --engine selection, chunking, srt/vtt/json output,
    m4a input via ffmpeg/PyAV.
  * History list/export over CLI and D-Bus (ExportHistory, API 1.4.0).
  * D-Bus activation for org.fede.whisperaloud with an Exec fallback;
    single daemon-start mechanism, no shortcut re-prompt.
  * Portal-based paste support under Flatpak.
  * Expanded e2e/GUI/private-bus test infrastructure and CI jobs.

 -- Federico <fede@example.com>  Fri, 02 Oct 2026 16:29:32 +0000

